8,The Song of the Mamuna Tribe: Listening Beyond the Frame,https://www.rareformaudio.com/blog/mamuna-tribe-song-south-papua,"A traditional song from the Mamuna Tribe of South Papua offers a powerful glimpse into ancestral memory through layered, unstructured vocal harmony. More than music, it's a living expression of identity and connection to land.","Kanum, Bädi",South-Central Papuan
9,Exploring the Rich Heritage of Papua Traditional Songs,https://papuaaround.com/exploring-the-rich-heritage-of-papua-traditional-songs/,"PapuaAround.com - In the diverse cultural tapestry of Indonesia, Papua stands out with its vibrant and distinct traditional music. The island's musical heritage is characterized by a variety of songs that not only entertain but also convey important aspects of Papuan culture and history. This article highlights ten notable traditional songs from Papua, offering a glimpse into the island ...","Kanum, Bädi",South-Central Papuan
